<title>TOGO: Togo's president heads for Kuwait, UAE.</title>
<headline>Togo's president heads for Kuwait, UAE.</headline>
<dateline>LOME 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Togolese President Gnassingbe Eyadema left for the Middle East on Monday for visits to Kuwait and the United Arab Emirates, officials said.</p>
<p>Eyadema, who has led his West African nation since seizing power in 1967, would discuss financial cooperation in Kuwait before heading for the UAE, informed Togolese sources said.</p>
